{"ID":"20240206135743-n2gwzl2","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206135743-n2gwzl2","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135743-n2gwzl2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135755-0h0yw2x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135748-6j4156m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135755-0h0yw2x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":" 青礞石","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102630"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135755-0h0yw2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135755-0h0yw2x","updated":"20240206135759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于浙江淳安、湖南、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t为鳞片状或片状集合体。呈不规则扁块状或长斜块状，无明显棱角。褐黑色或绿黑色，具玻璃样光泽。质软，易碎，断面呈较明显的层片状。碎粉主为绿黑色鳞片 (黑云母)，有似星点样的闪光。气微。味淡。\n【性味】\t咸、甘，平。\n【功效】\t坠痰下气，平肝镇惊。治顽痰胶结，咳逆喘急，癫痫发狂，烦躁胸闷，惊风抽搐。多入丸散服。\n【注解】\t“亮银星”：某些药材的一些成分在表面析出的结晶，在光照下可见点状闪光。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135748-6j4156m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135748-6j4156m","updated":"20240206135748"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135748-839c9pq.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708175335-y6hdpov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708175335-y6hdpov","updated":"20240708175335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708174749-nqm4nd4.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 398px;","style":"width: 388px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青礞石2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青礞石2-20240708175331-eyxakdc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 388px;\" parent-style=\"width: 398px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240708175000-cuaa9gi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708175000-cuaa9gi","updated":"20240830102520"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青礞石4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青礞石4-20240708175635-doyss4n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 248px;","style":"width: 238px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青礞石20240708_174939"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青礞石20240708_174939-20240708175000-b6afxvg.gif"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 238px;\" parent-style=\"width: 248px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708173716-wf7retk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708173716-wf7retk","updated":"20240708175548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 795px;","style":"width: 785px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"青礞石"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/青礞石-20240708173716-72iasr3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 785px;\" parent-style=\"width: 795px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830102540-mtpym1x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830102540-mtpym1x"}},{"ID":"20240830102623-daa2oqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-daa2oqs","updated":"20240830102630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：青礞石"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-rij5bng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-rij5bng","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青礞石《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-o6nqt3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-o6nqt3l","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QīnɡMénɡShí"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-vpw6vba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-vpw6vba","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】LAPISCHLORITI"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-ydb52dt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-ydb52dt","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】礞石"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-8s1q1j0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-8s1q1j0","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为变质岩类黑云母片岩或绿泥石化云母碳酸盐片岩。采挖后,除去泥沙和杂石。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-69vckxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-69vckxy","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-654tze2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-654tze2","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑云母片岩：主为鳞片状或片状集合体。呈不规则扁块状或长斜块状，无明显棱角。褐黑色或绿黑色，具玻璃样光泽。质软，易碎，断面呈较明显的层片状。碎粉主为绿黑色鳞片（黑云母），有似星点样的闪光。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-dbdxn8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-dbdxn8m","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"绿泥石化云母碳酸盐片岩：为鳞片状或粒状集合体。呈灰色或绿灰色，夹有银色或淡黄色鳞片，具光泽。质松，易碎，粉末为灰绿色鳞片（绿泥石化云母片）和颗粒（主为碳酸盐），片状者具星点样闪光。遇稀盐酸产生气泡，加热后泡沸激烈。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-e9laya1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-e9laya1","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-0o2cavg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-0o2cavg","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青礞石：除去杂石，砸成小块。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-v74920t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-v74920t","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煅青礞石：取净青礞石，照明煅法（附录ⅡD）煅至红透。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-qrli65l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-qrli65l","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、咸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-2nmg08k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-2nmg08k","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-hkuqjit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-hkuqjit","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】坠痰下气，平肝镇惊。用于顽痰胶结，咳逆喘急，癫痫发狂，烦躁胸闷，惊风抽搐。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-e2ryxdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-e2ryxdc","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～6g,多入丸散服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-ba9s70y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-ba9s70y","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-11zqmyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-11zqmyc","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-i240u00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-i240u00","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"青礞石《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-0hi0hxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-0hi0hxv","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】本品始载于《嘉佑本草》，云：“礞石……一名青礞石。”1．《品汇精要》谓：“礞石，今齐(今山东省泰山以北)鲁(今山东省泰山以南)山中有之，青色微有金星。”2．《纲目》记载：“礞石，江北(今湖北省蕲春县一带)诸山往往有之，以盱山出者为佳。有青、白二种，以青者为佳。坚细而青黑，打开中有白星点，煅后则星黄如麸金。其无星点者，不入药用。”并有附图一幅，为片状，有散在星状点，断面不"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-98vio5v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-98vio5v","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QīnɡMénɡShí"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-k5j53go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-k5j53go","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】LapisChloriti"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-b7ozpti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-b7ozpti","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】礞石"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-33lyd6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-33lyd6n","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-aglfe9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-aglfe9h","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为变质岩类黑云母片岩、绿泥石化云母碳酸盐片岩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-1tk8cay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-1tk8cay","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：BiotiteSchist；MicaCarbonateSchistbyChloritization"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-ibqob31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-ibqob31","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年可采，采得后除净杂石、泥土即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-u9tga9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-u9tga9t","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-h7emjvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-h7emjvj","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.黑云母片岩主要由黑云母及少量石英、中长石、绿帘石等矿物组成的集合体。呈不规则扁块状，无明显棱角，其中有鳞片状矿物具定向排列，彼此相连。断面可见明显的片状构造，鳞片状变晶结构。岩石呈黑色，有的带暗绿色调，珍珠光泽，质软而脆，易剥碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-w01vi1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-w01vi1v","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.绿泥石化云母碳酸盐片岩主要由方解石、白云石、金云母(部分转变为绿泥石，即绿泥石化)、绢云母、石英等矿物组成的集合体。呈不规则块体。其中粒状矿物和鳞片状矿物定向排列为片状结构，鳞片花岗变晶结构，但不甚明显。岩石呈灰绿色，夹于其中的鳞片状矿物显珍珠光泽。质较疏松，易剥碎。遇稀盐酸即有气泡发生。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-9gvv83t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-9gvv83t","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-s0j4kbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-s0j4kbk","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：产于接触变质区域变质基中酸碱性浸入岩及火成岩、伟晶岩中，是中酸性火成岩的主要造岩矿物之一。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-h22tvgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-h22tvgd","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于江苏、浙江、河南、湖北、湖南、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-d3bzlni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-d3bzlni","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-hba37wf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-hba37wf","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别(1)黑云母片岩：主为鳞片状或片状集合体。呈不规则扁块状或长斜块状，无明显棱角。褐黑色或绿黑色。具玻璃样光泽。质软，易碎，断面呈较明显层片状；碎粉主为黑色或绿黑色鳞片(黑云母)，有似星点样闪光。气微，味淡。以绿黑色、质软易碎、有光泽者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-u2t8b2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-u2t8b2a","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(2)绿泥石化云母碳酸盐片岩为粒状和小鳞片状集合体，呈不规则块状。灰色或绿灰色，夹有银色或淡黄色鳞片，具珍珠样光泽。质松软，易碎，碎粉为灰绿色小鳞片(绿泥石化云母片)和类白色颗粒(主为碳酸盐)，片状者具星点样闪光。遇稀盐酸发生气泡，加热后泡沸激烈。气微，味淡。以灰绿色、有光泽者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-33htwv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-33htwv4","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别(1)黑云母片岩主为黑云母及少量石英、中长石组成。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-ejphdo3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-ejphdo3","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黑云母：薄片中呈黄褐色至褐色；片状依一定方向排列；正突起中度；多色性和吸收性很强，Ng，Nm为深褐色，Np为黄色；Ng≥Nm\u003eNp；解理沿"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-f7zlfwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-f7zlfwq","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】黑云母片岩主要含钾、镁、铁、铝的硅酸盐[K(Mg·Fe)2(A1Si3O10)(OH，F)2〕，尚含有钛、钙、锰等杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-1059esi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-1059esi","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-zprn1dp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-zprn1dp","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.青礞石《嘉佑本草》：“细研为粉。”现行，取原药材，除去杂质及泥土，砸碎或碾成粉末。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-wm661lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-wm661lj","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.煅青礞石《品汇精要》：“每二两，捶碎，用焰硝二两，同入小砂罐内，瓦片盖定，铁线缚之，盐泥固济，晒干。火煅红，上有金星透出为度。候冷，研为极细末。”《本草蒙筌》：“欲辨假真，须依法制。敲碎小颗粒，贮倾银罐中，搀半焰硝，盐泥固济，武火煅一炷香，取出。色若雌黄、软脆易擂方为不假。成末以水飞细，入药作散为丸。”《本草乘雅半偈》：“以青色坚细、击开有白星点点者为贵。修治以大坩埚一个，用礞石四两，杵碎，入消石等分拌匀，炭火十五斤簇定，煅至消尽，星黄如麸金。取出研极细，水飞数过，晒干，再乳万匝。”《医宗金鉴》：“焰硝煅过，埋地内七日用。”现行，取净青礞石，置适宜耐火容器内，用无烟武火加热，煅至红透，取出放凉，碾细。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-jbvonj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-jbvonj6","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"饮片性状：青礞石参见“药材鉴别”项。煅青礞石呈粉末状，青黄绿色，质软，略有光泽。贮干燥容器内，置干燥处，防尘。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-hysmmt9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-hysmmt9","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘；咸；平；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-jr0hr3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-jr0hr3w","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；心；肝；胃；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-cdssg18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-cdssg18","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】坠痰下气；平肝定惊；消食攻积。主顽痰咳喘；癫痫发狂；烦躁胸闷；惊风抽搐；宿食癖积；症瘕"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-bi2nj8o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-bi2nj8o","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：入丸、散，3-6g；煎汤，10-15g，布包。"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-mi0yex4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-mi0yex4","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】非痰热内结不化之实证，或脾胃虚弱，阴虚燥痰及孕妇均禁服。1.《纲目》：“气弱脾虚者，不宜久服。”2.《本草从新》：“气弱血虚者大忌。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-05k459x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-05k459x","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】《纲目》:“其色蒙蒙然，故名。”"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-9w5w6c2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-9w5w6c2","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】1.《品汇精要》：“旧本不载所出州郡，今齐鲁山中有之。青色微有金星，其质坚理细，凿制为磨，取其出物最速，为末亦细。及考王隐君论痰致病百端，入滚痰丸用之，丹溪治食积成痰，良有验也。”2.《本草乘雅半偈》：“有青、白、赭三色，以青色坚细，击开有白黑点之者为贵。”3.《本经逢原》：“青者入肝力胜，色黄者兼脾次之。者，不宜久服。杨士瀛谓其功能利痰，而性非胃家所好，如慢惊之类，皆宜佐以木香。而王隐君则谓痰为百病，不论虚实寒热，概用滚痰丸通治百病，岂理也哉?朱丹溪言一老人忽病目盲，乃大虚证，一医与礞石药服之，至夜而死。吁!此乃盲医虚虚之过，礞石岂杀人者乎!况目盲之病，与礞石并不相干。”(《纲目》)3．1．缪希雍：“礞石禀石中刚猛之性，体重而降，能消一切积聚痰结，消积滞，坠痰涎，诚为要药。然而攻击太过，性复沉坠，凡积滞症结脾胃壮实者可用，如虚弱者忌之；小儿惊痰食积实热，初发者可用，虚寒久病者忌之。如王隐君制滚痰丸，谓百病皆生于痰，不论虚实寒热概用，殊为未妥。不知痰有二因，因于脾胃不能运化积滞生痰，或多食酒面湿热之物，以致胶固稠粘，咯唾难出者用之，豁痰利窍，除热泄结，应如桴鼓；因于阴虚火炎，煎熬津液，凝结为痰，或发热声哑，痰血杂出者，如误投之，则阴气愈虚，阳火反炽，痰热未退而脾胃已为败矣，可见前人立方不能无弊，是在后人善于简择耳。”(《本草经疏》)3．2．周志林：“青礞石善化老痰癖积，沉降下行，吐痰在水上，以末掺之，痰即随水而下。同火硝煅炼者，取其疏利之性，则礞石之性更为剽悍耳。独入肝家，治惊痫痰涎胶粘不化，不外咸能软坚，重以镇邪之意。”(《本草用法研究》)4．论礞石宜煅：唐容川：“礞石，必用火硝煅过，性始能发，乃能坠痰，不煅则石质不化，药性不发，又毒不散，故必用煅。”(《本草问答》)"}]},{"ID":"20240830102623-45w3wyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102623-45w3wyg","updated":"20240830102631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830102624-qebua2p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830102624-qebua2p","updated":"20240830102631"}},{"ID":"20240830102625-4gxe1kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830102625-4gxe1kb","updated":"20240830102631"}}]}